# pmax-sentry-mcp

Read-only Model Context Protocol (MCP) server for PMax Sentry.
Exposes 11 deterministic tools for AI assistants to inspect PMax campaign delivery, run data quality preflights, evaluate experiment power, analyze causal experiments, and generate decision contracts.
Contains NO campaign mutation or bid-writing tools.
